{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "留在总编室  (Staying in the Chief Editor's Office)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the chief editor's office at Xingtian, producers Kaiwen and Xingzi celebrate catching company mole Wang Er, and ask Chun Yuqiao what to do with Wang Er's intern Bu Xiaogu. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "事情都处理完了，这次证据太明显了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样就可以证明谁是内鬼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们终于可以放心了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "王尔解决了，那个实习生怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她今天晚上给我打电话，跟我道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她是诚实的，王尔的事她不知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷做事很努力，而且她是清白的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "布小谷留下来，在哪个部门干什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别的部门不要，就留在总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你以前说总编室永远不招实习生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我当然不带她，你带！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "知道了，我们开会吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's hear how they decide Xiaogu's future line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "事情都处理完了，这次证据太明显了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything has been handled; the evidence this time was way too obvious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样就可以证明谁是内鬼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That proves who the mole inside the company is.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们终于可以放心了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We can finally relax now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "王尔解决了，那个实习生怎么办？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wang Er is dealt with, so what about that intern?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她今天晚上给我打电话，跟我道歉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She called me tonight and apologized to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "她是诚实的，王尔的事她不知道。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She is honest; she knew nothing about Wang Er's scheme.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷做事很努力，而且她是清白的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu works hard, and besides, she is innocent.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "布小谷留下来，在哪个部门干什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If Bu Xiaogu stays on, what will she do and in which department?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "别的部门不要，就留在总编室。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If no other department wants her, she stays in the chief editor's office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你以前说总编室永远不招实习生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You used to say the chief editor's office never takes interns.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我当然不带她，你带！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course I am not mentoring her — you mentor her!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "知道了，我们开会吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got it — let's start the meeting.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "事情都处理完了，这次证据太明显了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样就可以证明谁是内鬼。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们终于可以放心了。",
      "gap": 0.5
